      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;In a world plagued by violent, greedy vampires, only the werewolf Pack of Bright Moon can stop them. Adora is selected to be turned into a vampire, but soon learns the harsh truths about the clan that raised her, and it causes a schism between Adora and her oldest friend. Adora turns to the Pack for help, and Catra has important decisions to make.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
